                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1b36e26b-7f60-3db1-a6a8-92aab1794292",
                        "entry_id": "ca53b094-8f2d-336a-bbfb-20eae0e63514",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A plane surface with four equal sides and four right angles; a square; hence, figuratively, anything having the outline of a square."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "677e384b-f7fd-48a3-9dbc-ffb635070b94",
                                "sense_id": "1b36e26b-7f60-3db1-a6a8-92aab1794292",
                                "text": "At which command, the powers militant\nThat stood for heav'n, in mighty quadrate joyn'd."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9836f5df-2385-35d6-88ce-6477a973e1b8",
                        "entry_id": "ca53b094-8f2d-336a-bbfb-20eae0e63514",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An aspect of the heavenly bodies in which they are distant from each other 90°, or the quarter of a circle; quartile."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
